  m_text: 'You have $20 and two good paws.

    <b>Work:</b> Slice of Trouble, across the street, needs a delivery panda.

    <b>Trouble:</b> the pawn shop sells a pistol. QuickPaw Mart has a full register.

    <b>Getting away:</b> stay out of sight until the heat dies down. Stolen cash in your satchel becomes yours once you escape.

    Hold A + X if you get stuck.'
